        "datePublished": "2026-09-01",
        "name": "Timeless Classic",
        "reviewBody": "Ikea made a timeless classic with the FADO. I\u2019ve had mine for years and it\u2019s one of the only lamps that has survived my many home redesigns. The light is warm and still receive compliments as if it was brand new. You can\u2019t go wrong with a perfectly proportioned orb lamp. 10/10 stars",
