          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Breann"
        },
        "datePublished": "2026-08-26",
        "name": "beautiful and broken",
        "reviewBody": "this lamp is beautiful and works so well with colorful bulbs. but, similar to other reviewers, the springs that hold in the glass WILL shatter it if you move it. i lifted it maybe an inch to dust underneath and it shattered and i was cut. they replaced it, and i will not be using the springs to hold it onto the base next time. maybe some putty or something else would be better to hold it in place, but be warned if you try to move it that there should be NO pressure on the cord when you shift it!",
        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": 3
        }
      },
      {
