        },
        "datePublished": "2026-08-15",
        "name": "Black mark on glass",
        "reviewBody": "Im not sure what it\u2019s from but its not worth the process of returning, there\u2019s just a black mark that was hidden under a sticker than won\u2019t wipe off maybe it was debris that got into it during the glass making process. It\u2019s not the end of the world but I just have to position the lamp a certain way to make sure it doesn\u2019t show.",
        "reviewRating": {
