        "datePublished": "2026-07-09",
        "name": "Visible defects in the glass",
        "reviewBody": "The lamp itself is attractive and works as expected, but my glass globe arrived with several visible cosmetic defects. They're noticeable when the lamp is turned on, although I was able to rotate the globe so they're less visible from my normal viewing angle.\n\nIf you're buying this lamp, inspect the globe carefully when you unbox it in case yours has similar cosmetic defects.",
